  "verdict": "needs-correction",
  "finding_class": "learner-critical-answer",
  "rationale": "The English cue and both translations identify the same automotive device, but the national distinction is materially overstated. Malaysian authoritative terminology uses \"pengelap cermin depan\", while Malaysian automotive usage also uses the borrowing \"wiper\"; Indonesian automotive usage likewise uses \"wiper\" alongside native equivalents such as \"penyeka kaca\". The forms are reasonable variety-associated preferences, not reliably different common words. The blank contrast also fails to explain the overlap or establish a genuine false-friend distinction.",
  "claim_reviews": [
    {
      "subject": "English cue and sense",
      "conclusion": "Correct. \"Windshield wiper\" is a vehicle component that removes rain or water from the windshield.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://dictionary.cambridge.org/us/dictionary/english/windshield-wiper"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Indonesian answer: wiper kaca",
      "conclusion": "Plausible and understandable Indonesian automotive usage, but not an exclusive national form. Indonesian sources also describe the item as wiper or penyeka kaca.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://www.daihatsu.co.id/tips-and-event/tips-sahabat/detail-content/komponen-wiper-mobil-dan-tips-mengatasi-kerusakannya/",
        "https://www.jica.go.jp/domestic/chubu/information/topics/2024/__icsFiles/afieldfile/2024/05/09/1.pdf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Malaysian answer: pengelap cermin",
      "conclusion": "Supported as standard Malaysian terminology, more fully \"pengelap cermin depan\" for a windshield wiper.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=72508&keyword=pengelap",
        "https://cms-assets.proton.com/proton-cms-blob/media/stijfnhw/persona_owners_manual_jan2024_compressed.pdf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "National split and relation",
      "conclusion": "The label \"different-common-word\" is too categorical. The two supplied forms are different lexical choices, but they overlap in referent, and Malaysian usage also includes the borrowing \"wiper\"; therefore the better relation is shared meaning with variety preference or non-exclusive regional preference.",
      "material_risk": true,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=72508&keyword=pengelap",
        "https://www.automotivespareparts.my/products/wiper-blades/",
        "https://www.daihatsu.co.id/tips-and-event/tips-sahabat/detail-content/komponen-wiper-mobil-dan-tips-mengatasi-kerusakannya/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "False-friend contrast",
      "conclusion": "No genuine false-friend contrast is supported: both answers denote the same windshield-wiping device. The empty contrast field is an instructional omission; it should state the overlap and, if retained, explain preference rather than implying semantic divergence.",
      "material_risk": true,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://dictionary.cambridge.org/us/dictionary/english/windshield-wiper",
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=72508&keyword=pengelap",
        "https://www.jica.go.jp/domestic/chubu/information/topics/2024/__icsFiles/afieldfile/2024/05/09/1.pdf"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
